```c
if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_BT_BAP_UNICAST_SERVER) {
     bt_bap_unicast_server_cb_get();
}
```

I do not agree it creates stronger coupling.
The callback structure can be easily replaced now with ascs-type callback (I mean something like `bt_ascs_cb`).

